@baseURL = http://localhost:3000

### ===== EVENTOS (públicos) =====

### Listar eventos
GET {{baseURL}}/events

### Buscar evento por id
GET {{baseURL}}/events/1

### Evento inexistente (esperado: 404)
GET {{baseURL}}/events/999

### ===== AUTENTICAÇÃO =====

### Cadastrar novo usuário (esperado: 201)

POST {{baseURL}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "novo@ifrs.edu.br",
  "password": "senha123"
}

### Cadastrar o mesmo e-mail de novo (esperado: 409

POST {{baseURL}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "novo@ifrs.edu.br",
  "password": "senha123"
}

### Login com senha errada (esperado: 401)

POST {{baseURL}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@ifrs.edu.br",
  "password": "errada"
}

### Login como admin (esperado: 200 + token). Copie o valor do campo token da resposta
POST {{baseURL}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@ifrs.edu.br",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Login como usuário comum (esperado: 200 + token). Copie o valor do campo token da resposta
POST {{baseURL}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "usuario@ifrs.edu.br",
  "password": "123456"
}

### ===== DASHBOARD =====

### Dashboard sem token (esperado: 401)
GET {{baseURL}}/dashboard

### Dashboard com token de usuário comum (esperado: 200)
### Cole o token do usuario@ifrs.edu.br no lugar de {{COLE_SEU_TOKEN_AQUI}} (sem as chaves)
GET {{baseURL}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJlbWFpbCI6InVzdWFyaW9AaWZycy5lZHUuYnIiLCJyb2xlIjoidXNlciIsImlhdCI6MTc5MjM0MDM1MiwiZXhwIjoxNzkyMzQzOTUyfQ.tl3QfC-mqz5tcEoWbi2hSBM_fbuRMWnQrI9ID-o1_v0

### ===== EVENTOS (protegidos) =====

### Criar evento SEM token (esperado: 401)
POST {{baseURL}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Teste",
  "location": "Qualquer",
  "event_date": "2026-12-20",
  "max_volunteers": 3
}

### Criar evento com token de usuário comum (esperado: 403)
### Use o token do usuario@ifrs.edu.br
POST {{baseURL}}/events
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJlbWFpbCI6ImFkbWluQGlmcnMuZWR1LmJyIiwicm9sZSI6ImFkbWluIiwiaWF0IjoxNzkyMzQwMzA5LCJleHAiOjE3OTIzNDM5MDl9.uKqsHlg8mExfKATJ1t36xIhgYTGh6R81pYlkL532UZo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Teste",
  "location": "Qualquer",
  "event_date": "2026-12-20",
  "max_volunteers": 3
}

### Criar evento com token de administrador (esperado: 201)
### Use o token do admin@ifrs.edu.br
POST {{baseURL}}/events
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJlbWFpbCI6ImFkbWluQGlmcnMuZWR1LmJyIiwicm9sZSI6ImFkbWluIiwiaWF0IjoxNzkyMzQwNDAzLCJleHAiOjE3OTIzNDQwMDN9.2JcsAbXqYMoSKKDh9KiX6DjJvKWQh6WwSlErx-JP4Qc
Content-Type: application/json

